ión y cierre de saldo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:19px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#E5E7EB;font-weight:normal&quot;&gt;Pendiente → Cancelado.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:19px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#E5E7EB;font-weight:normal&quot;&gt;Parcial abierto → Cerrado con recepción parcial.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:19px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#E5E7EB;font-weight:normal&quot;&gt;Acciones internas de CU18b; sin RF ni rutas propias.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:19px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#E5E7EB;font-weight:normal&quot;&gt;Confirmar actualiza V27; cancelar el diálogo conserva estado y cantidades.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:19px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#E5E7EB;font-weight:normal&quot;&gt;Ninguna de estas acciones modifica stock.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=28;fillColor=#1A202B;strokeColor=#3A4556;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#E5E7EB;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60.0" y="1052.0" width="550.0" height="147.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="Provee-17" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:17px;line-height:24px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#C4A5F5;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;Recibir entrega, dentro de V27&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:19px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#E5E7EB;font-weight:normal&quot;&gt;Mostrar solicitado, recibido acumulado, pendiente y cantidad de ESTA entrega.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:19px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#E5E7EB;font-weight:normal&quot;&gt;Enteros entre 0 y pendiente; al menos una línea positiva; costo y vencimiento cuando corresponda.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:19px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#E5E7EB;font-weight:normal&quot;&gt;Confirmar: completa el saldo → Recibido; queda saldo → Parcial y permite otra entrega.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:19px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#E5E7EB;font-weight:normal&quot;&gt;Error o datos de lote incompletos: rechaza toda la nueva entrega; conserva entregas anteriores.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:19px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#E5E7EB;font-weight:normal&quot;&gt;Reintento: la misma operación no duplica la recepción.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=28;fillColor=#211D2B;strokeColor=#6F6385;strokeWidth=1.2;dashed=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#E5E7EB;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="725.0" y="1052.0" width="1215.0" height="147.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="Provee-18" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:17px;line-height:24px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#C4A5F5;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;Estados terminales, consulta e historial&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:19px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#E5E7EB;font-weight:normal&quot;&gt;Recibido: todas las cantidades entregadas. Cancelado: terminó sin recepciones.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:19px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#E5E7EB;font-weight:normal&quot;&gt;Cerrado con recepción parcial: conserva entregas, lotes y faltante; no modifica stock.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:19px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#E5E7EB;font-weight:normal&quot;&gt;En estos estados no se aceptan nuevas recepciones.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:19px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#E5E7EB;font-weight:normal&quot;&gt;Volver del detalle a la lista no cambia el pedido.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=28;fillColor=#211D2B;strokeColor=#6F6385;strokeWidth=1.2;dashed=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#E5E7EB;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="725.0" y="1279.0" width="1215.0" height="128.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="p5" name="Personal"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2000" pageHeight="2453" background="#121212" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="p5-bg" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#121212;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="2000" height="2453" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="p5-t" value="PERSONAL" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=26;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#D6DCE6;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="22" width="2000" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="p5-e0" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;rounded=1;strokeColor=#8E7CB0;strokeWidth=1.4;endArrow=none;endFill=1;dashed=1;fontColor=#E5E7EB;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#121212;fontFamily=Helvetica;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="335.0" y="371.0" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="335.0" y="397.0" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p5-e1" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;rounded=1;strokeColor=#8E7CB0;strokeWidth=1.4;endArrow=none;endFill=1;dashed=1;fontColor=#E5E7EB;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#121212;fontFamily=Helvetica;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1000.0" y="371.0" as=